halt-loop-prompts/
clear-project-output/
code-review-output/

# Written by `pnpm release`; read by verify-release-published.mjs within the same job.
.release-publish.log

# Personal maintenance registry — not project documentation (see ~/.claude/CLAUDE.md).
BACKLOG.md

# Runtime locks. `shared_file.locked()` creates one while a mechanism holds a
# file and removes it on release, so a tracked lock is a transient artefact that
# shows as a deletion after every legitimate run. `.BACKLOG.md.lock` was tracked
# until 2026-09-20 and did exactly that.
*.lock
!pnpm-lock.yaml
